<title>USA: General Scanning Q3 shr.</title>
<headline>General Scanning Q3 shr.</headline>
<dateline>WATERTOWN, Mass. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.26		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net		 2,921		    1,575</p>
<p> Sales	     32,833		   27,064</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,514		   10,128</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.72		    $0.46</p>
<p> Net		 7,998		    3,822</p>
<p> Sales	     99,294		   72,648</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  12,483		   9,699</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Consolidated results follow.</p>
<p>NOTE: Tabular results exclude General Scanning Inc's acquisition of View Engineering Inc. The acquisition was completed August 27.</p>
<p>Reflecting the acquisition, results were:</p>
<p>For the quarter, shr $0.07 vs $0.13, net 929,000 vs 1,351,000 and sales, 38,163,000 vs 33,681,000 and avg shrs 12,514,000 vs 10,128,000. Current quarter includes merger costs of $1.95 million.</p>
<p>For the nine months, shr $0.35 vs $0.30, net 4,406,000 vs 2,891,000, sales 116,517,000 vs 90,817,000 and avg shrs 12,483,000 vs 9,699,000.</p>
<p>Current quarter, nine months include merger costs of $1.95 million.</p>
</text>
